  padding:3.8pt 5.75pt 2.2pt 9.6pt;height:20.1pt'>
  <p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
  mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt'>9<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
